<title>USA: HomeCapital Investment to offer loans.</title>
<headline>HomeCapital Investment to offer loans.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>HomeCapital Investment Corp said Friday that its operating subsidiary has signed a license agreement to offer its home improvement loans to customers of Builders Square Inc retail stores.</p>
<p>Under the agreement, the loan program will be implemented as a pilot test in stores in San Antonio and Houston by HomeCapital's subsidiary, HomeOwners Mortgage &amp; Equity Inc.</p>
<p>The service would then be expanded to other Builders Square retail stores in June 1997, if the pilot test is successful, the company said.</p>
<p>Builders Square is a subsidiary of Kmart Corp.</p>
</text>
